00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.270 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  22 years ago keanu reeves impressed fans  across the globe in his role as neo and  the matrix movie series after the last  part which was released 18 years ago the  prospect of another sequel was not  really promising as has now been known  for almost two years though in one of  the two original masterminds of the  trilogy lana vokowski is devoting her  attention to a fourth part expectations  couldn't be any higher which is why in  today's original we will be compiling  all the facts about the matrix 4 thus  far as well as doing a bit of  speculating regarding the plot  first let's talk about the cast as  already mentioned veteran store keanu  reeves can once again show what he's got  as neo  also bank will be colleague carrie and  moses trinity and that despite the fact  that they both originally lost their  lives at the end of the matrix  revolutions  most likely jada pinkett smith will also  rejoin the cast as niobe having played  one of zion's strongest fighters in the  last two parts  daniel bernard is also expected to be  seen again as agent johnson of course  many are wondering about the whereabouts  of the merovinian who like his wife  posiphony played a major role in the  film series lambert wilson and monica  bellucci could slip back into their  roles but this is not yet confirmed all  the more certain is an appearance by  aquaman starria abdulmadin ii who  according to the rumors is supposed to  embody a younger morpheus he himself was  neither able nor allowed to comment on  this in an interview with entertainment  weekly even though he would have loved  to talk about the matrix 4 as he said  himself if the rumors are true it  remains to be seen as to what will  happen to the original morpheus who was  played by lawrence fishburne the 60 year  old affirms that he was not cast for the  matrix 4 which in turn increases the  likelihood that abdel medin will indeed  play a young morpheus hugo weaving will  also have to say goodbye to his role as  agent smith as he was not asked to take  part in the project either instead there  are two prominent newcomers neil patrick  harris as well as iron fist star jessica  henwick both are said to play important  roles in the upcoming film also joining  the caster jonathan roth priyanka chopra  jonas andrew caldwell alan hallman and  stephen graham  now let's move on to the plot in fact  there is absolutely no information  whatsoever about what exactly the film  will be about the crux of the matter is  of course the fact that neo is alive  contrary to the events of the third  movie in the following we would like to  discuss some theories on how it comes to  be that neo is still alive or rather  alive again  the protagonist had to face his opponent  agent smith in the matrix revolutions  resulting in the machines killing both  neo and smith due to a power search  by making this sacrifice neo has  basically saved humanity and given it a  more peaceful future thanks to his  selfless act  many fans support the theory that neo  was not really deleted those of you who  are computer literate will know that it  is extremely difficult to really delete  something entirely from the digital  world only a specialist could certainly  retrieve a supposedly irrevocably  removed file by means of individual  fragments especially in the vast matrix  network it is quite plausible that a  version of the protagonist is actually  saved somewhere in the data and could be  brought back to life  if necessary this won't bring back his  physical body but within the matrix neo  could still exist  next the following aspect should not be  disregarded the possibility of time  travel we've known not just since the  mcu that many movies like to build on  the existence of different timelines  particularly in the extremely complex  world of the matrix time travel doesn't  sound like an all too bold idea this  theory is backed by the signing of the  presumably younger morpheus yaya abdul  madin ii of course the machines could  take neo and trinity from the past for  example and have them fight in the  future however then one would have to  explain somehow why the two look  significantly older than prior to the  death in the third part sure they could  also use various tricks to rejuvenate  the actors but we consider that rather  unlikely  another really interesting theory is  that kian reeves is not going to play  neo at all but instead the next version  of the chosen one after all after the  reset of the old simulation we don't  know exactly what the new one is  supposed to look like hence reeves could  easily play neo's successor a completely  new character in a completely new role  so to speak the chosen one could then  take longer to understand what's  happening around him this time it's kind  of a bizarre idea but one that isn't all  that far-fetched finally we'll introduce  you to the theory of neo's immortality  and the first the matrix part neo  impressively shows how he can heal  himself from a bullet wound sure you  could argue that this is no longer  possible once this source's power in  neo's body is extinguished in fact the  most popular theory about the matrix  film series is that it is an analogy to  the life of jesus he dies resurrects and  eventually sacrifices himself for the  people just like neo if you keep  thinking about this theory neo actually  didn't die at all he is just waiting for  the moment of his return fascinating  idea isn't it those were our four  theories on the plot and neos  whereabouts do you have any other ideas  on how things could continue feel free  to write your thoughts down in the  comments  to conclude let's take a look at the  production  as previously hinted at the matrix four  was written and directed by alana  vakowski along with the successful  authors alexander hammond and david  mitchell as reeves himself pointed out  the script resembles a love story and is  intended to be a sort of wake up call  for the audience shooting of the matrix  4 began in february 2020 and took mostly  place in san francisco as well as at  studio bubblesburg in potsdam germany  although it was temporarily hauled after  a few weeks due to the pandemic filming  finally ended in november of last year  the release date of the upcoming  blockbuster is actually scheduled for  this year on december 22nd 2021  there you go again with our latest  original if you like this video please  subscribe to our channel and hit the  notification bell so that you will  always be up to date in the future  see you next time  [Music]  you

